From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:32:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] docs: record which APKs of a bundle an install takes (ADR
 0091)

The installer now chooses among a bundle's APKs: by content rather than
by suffix, by toc.pb for a bundletool APK set, by manifest.json for an
XAPK, with every density and language split kept and expansion files
and encrypted APKM files reported. Record the decision and the
alternatives (every APK, the file layout without toc.pb, only the
device's densities and languages) in ADR 0091, and point app/README.md's
install section and docs/installer.md at it.

